  <running_head>CANTICORVM.</running_head>
  <main_text>
    <l n="1" para="true">Mala spirant vspiam:</l>
    <l n="2" para="true">9. Vt tuo quo profluit-</l>
    <l n="3">Epalato denique-</l>
    <l n="4">Ter beatus hauriam.</l>
    <l n="5">Vini ad instar optimi,</l>
    <l n="6">Suauiter quod transiens,</l>
    <l n="7">Atque recta defluens,</l>
    <l n="8">Vnico hauftum spiritu,</l>
    <l n="9">Se bibentem recreat:</l>
    <l n="10">Atque dormientum-</l>
    <l n="11">Labra quod fari docet.</l>
    <l n="12" para="true">SPONSA. (mi,10.</l>
    <l n="13">Tu me amicā, amice-</l>
    <l n="14">Vnus omnem possides:</l>
    <l n="15">Vnicam vt me respicit-</l>
    <l n="16">Hoc tuum omne cor eulum.</l>
    <l n="17" para="true">11. Huc ades quē diligo,</l>
    <l n="18">Rus ejmus vt simul,</l>
    <l n="19">Noête &amp; inter arbores-</l>
    <l n="20">Sic perafta Cyprias,</l>
    <l n="21">Luce prima ad vineas-</l>
    <l n="22">Prodeuntes sedulæ,</l>
    <l n="23" para="true">12. Quæritemus, gemulasIám-</l>
    <l n="24">ne viris truserit,</l>
    <l n="25">Atque botri formulam-</l>
    <l n="26">Proferat tenelluli:</l>
    <l n="27">Mala iámne cœperint-</l>
    <l n="28">Germinare punica.</l>
    <l n="29">Hic meos vbi tibi,</l>
    <l n="30">Sponse amores largiar,</l>
    <l n="31" para="true">13. Ecce odoros vndique-</l>
    <l n="32">Prodeuntes flosculos:</l>
    <l n="33">Fcce iam promptum tibi-</l>
    <l n="34">Dulce quicquid spiram</l>
    <l n="35">Sunt, amice, condita.</l>
    <l n="36" type="heading" level="1" para="true">ODE VIII.</l>
    <l n="37" para="true">1. O quis istud det mihi,F-</l>
    <l n="38">actus vt frater mihi,</l>
    <l n="39">Ipsius fugas meæ-</l>
    <l n="40">Tu parentis vbera:</l>
    <l n="41">2. Omne citra vt dedecus</l>
    <l n="42">Vt foror fratrem folet,</l>
    <l n="43">Conuenirem te foris,</l>
    <l n="44">Ofculaser te foris,</l>
    <l n="45">Te parentis in domum</l>
    <l n="46">Intimam perducerem,</l>
    <l n="47">Hic vbi felix tuis</l>
    <l n="48">Erudita vocibus,</l>
    <l n="49">Nectar mutuo tibi,</l>
    <l n="50">Et meis ex punicis</l>
    <l n="51">Vina preffa funderem.</l>
    <l n="52" para="true">3. Fallor, an mihi caput</l>
    <l n="53">Iam finistra fustinet?</l>
    <l n="54">Altera iam dextra</l>
    <l n="55">Languidam complectitur?</l>
    <l n="56">Testor at vos, virgines</l>
    <l n="57">O Sionis incolæ,</l>
    <l n="58">Sic Deus vos sospitet.</l>
    <l n="59">Vnice chari mihi</l>
    <l n="60">Ne quietem rumpite:</l>
    <l n="61">Neue somnos frangite,</l>
    <l n="62">Donec vltro iam vigil</l>
    <l n="63">Ipse sese surrigat.</l>
    <l n="64" type="heading" level="3" para="true">SPONSVS.</l>
    <l n="65" para="true">4. Ista quænam est aridis</l>
    <l n="66">Prodiens ex saltibus?</l>
    <l n="67">Quæ tam amicè blandiens</l>
    <l n="68">Sic amico niteris?</l>
    <l n="69" type="heading" level="3" para="true">SPONSA.</l>
    <l n="70" para="true">5. Illa certè ipsissima,</l>
    <l n="71">Quæ te in istud cælitus</l>
    <l n="72">Dulce quoque vipiam</l>
    <l n="73">Atque delicatulum,</l>
    <l n="74">Seu vetustum seu nouum:</l>
    <l n="75">Canctaque x soli tibi</l>
